44	Multiple Choice	Romantic Movement	One of the most evocative eras in the history of poetry must surely be that of the Romantic Movement. During the late eighteenth and early nineteenth centuries, a group of poets created a new mood in literary objectives, casting off their predecessors’ styles in favor of a gripping and forceful art that endures with us to this day. Five poets emerged as the main constituents of this movement – William Wordsworth, Samuel Taylor Coleridge, George Gordon Byron, Percy Bysshe Shelley, and John Keats. The strength of their works lies undoubtedly in the power of their imagination. Indeed, imagination was the most critical attribute of the Romantic poets. Each poet had the ability to portray remarkable images and visions, although differing to a certain degree in their intensity and presentation. Nature, mythology, and emotion were of great importance and were used to explore the feelings of the poet himself.	[{"id": 1, "text": "Which is considered to be the most evocative era in the history of poetry?", "type": "single", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "Pastoralism"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Metaphysical poets"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Elizabethan & Shakespearean Era"}, {"id": "D", "text": "Romantic Movement"}], "correctAnswers": ["D"]}, {"id": 2, "text": "In which century did a group of poets create a new mood in literature?", "type": "single", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "15th & 16th century"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Late 18th century"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Late 18th & early 19th century"}, {"id": "D", "text": "None of the above"}], "correctAnswers": ["C"]}, {"id": 3, "text": "How many poets were the main constituents of the Romantic Movement?", "type": "single", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "Six poets"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Five Poets"}, {"id": "C", "text": "A group of 7 poets"}, {"id": "D", "text": "Three poets"}], "correctAnswers": ["B"]}, {"id": 4, "text": "What is considered to be one of the most critical attributes of romantic poets?", "type": "single", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "Descriptive imagery"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Choice of meter"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Imagination"}, {"id": "D", "text": "Emotions & Intentions"}], "correctAnswers": ["C"]}, {"id": 5, "text": "What elements were important for poets to explore their feelings?", "type": "single", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "Nature"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Mythology"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Emotions"}, {"id": "D", "text": "All of the above"}], "correctAnswers": ["D"]}]	2024-08-21 19:39:57.949584	2024-08-21 19:39:57.949584
